OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will turn
OL,6,Fmuch wetter and breezier tonight as
OL,7,Frain arrives and sweeps across the
OL,8,Fregion through the morning.
OL,9,FTemperatures recover to give a milder
OL,10,Ffeel, especially towards Cornwall.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAlthough winds tend to ease on
OL,13,FFriday morning, it will still be
OL,14,Frather wet and murky throughout with
OL,15,Fheavy rain and widespread low cloud. A
OL,16,Fless cold day than Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
