OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThe
OL,6,Fweekend will begin rather unsettled
OL,7,Fwith heavy rain and gusty winds on
OL,8,FSaturday. Clearing Sunday and becoming
OL,9,Ffine, dry and milder, with winds
OL,10,Fincreasing again on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
